{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><figure><img src=\"https://cdn3.am730.com.hk/processed/2026-10/1059452/block/singleImage/3243951/df/01M5E3J3ZQZNNA5GHHD01WQSAV.png?updatedAt=1792556093\"/><figcaption>黃竹坑大王爺廟發生火警(Threads)</figcaption></figure><p>黃竹坑大王爺廟發生火警，周二(20日)晚上11時41分，多名市民報案，指南朗山道1號大王爺廟冒煙起火。消防到場開動一條喉和派出一隊煙帽隊撲救，約10分鐘將火救熄，經調查後，懷疑廟內香火引燃附近鐵架引致火警。事件中無人受傷。 影片可見，事發時廟宇火光熊熊，有濃煙由頂部冒出。及後地面有大量灰燼、焦黑殘骸及雜物，鐵架被熏黑。廟宇屋簷及簷篷位置留下煙熏痕迹。</p><p>在 Threads 查看</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-21T04:20:34.903557+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":210,"images":1,"source":"am730","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-21T02:11:08+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-21T04:57:51.124082+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-21T04:18:00.093291+00:00","content_hash":"2f04923aa895f534475e78bb41a2d1de42b6ae28ba19c59068732cfb6982b82a","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}